    "detailed_description": "Cycle of Steel is a fast paced roguelike adventure, where you make it through a randomly generated dungeon, utilizing various weapons to shoot down enemies along the way. <br>Explore a destopic scenery, ravaged by heartless robots, all drawn in satisfying pixel art. <br>It's free, give it a shot.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3136590/extras/6f2151477fbec3872efcc783d72f1b7f.poster.avif?t=1724197721\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3136590/extras/6f2151477fbec3872efcc783d72f1b7f.webm?t=1724197721\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3136590/extras/6f2151477fbec3872efcc783d72f1b7f.mp4?t=1724197721\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Control a hacked robot against the AI\u2019s army, The Knights of the Holy Code. Search for the one controlling them all, and bring them, or it, down to ruin.<br><br>Pick up your weapon and fire, with a top down perspective shooter, and roguelike elements to keep the game interesting.<br><br>Keep respawning and purchashing upgrades to get further every time.<br><br>Figure out your playstyle with differing weapons, taking it slow and steady with a laser rifle, or hot and fast with piercing shotgun rounds!<br><br>And more details to find, like environmental effects, in this indie game created by a team with a passion.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3136590/extras/f9c320cb72723fc5cd5b417d9be8c69b.poster.avif?t=1724197721\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3136590/extras/f9c320cb72723fc5cd5b417d9be8c69b.webm?t=1724197721\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3136590/extras/f9c320cb72723fc5cd5b417d9be8c69b.mp4?t=1724197721\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>You can't give up, if your robot is destroyed, you must make more to break the cycle of steel.",
